@catalog = http://localhost:8081
@shop = http://localhost:8082
@risk = http://localhost:8083
@behavior = http://localhost:8084

### UC06 搜索筛选
GET {{catalog}}/api/catalog/products?keyword=Java&category=BOOK&minPrice=10&maxPrice=100&sort=priceAsc

### UC06 商品详情（将 1 替换为实际在售商品 ID）
GET {{catalog}}/api/catalog/products/1

### UC07 新建草稿
POST {{catalog}}/api/catalog/seller/products
X-Seller-Id: 7
Content-Type: application/json

{"shopId":8,"name":"演示商品","description":"安全描述","category":"DIGITAL","price":99.00,"stock":3}

### UC07 提交审核（替换 ID）
POST {{catalog}}/api/catalog/seller/products/1/actions/SUBMIT
X-Seller-Id: 7

### UC08 公开店铺
GET {{shop}}/api/shops/8

### UC08 修改设置
PUT {{shop}}/api/shops/seller/current/settings
X-Seller-Id: 7
Content-Type: application/json

{"name":"第八组精品店","announcement":"欢迎光临","open":true}

### UC08 发布装修
PUT {{shop}}/api/shops/seller/current/decoration
X-Seller-Id: 7
Content-Type: application/json

{"template":"GRID","contentJson":"{\"hero\":\"summer\"}"}

### UC09 待审核列表
GET {{risk}}/api/admin/risk-audits?status=PENDING
X-Admin-Id: 99

### UC09 审核驳回（替换 ID）
POST {{risk}}/api/admin/risk-audits/1/decision
X-Admin-Id: 99
Content-Type: application/json

{"approved":false,"reason":"命中违禁规则"}

### UC10 记录浏览
POST {{behavior}}/api/behavior/browse-history
X-User-Id: 3
Content-Type: application/json

{"productId":1,"productType":"NEW"}

### UC10 记录搜索
POST {{behavior}}/api/behavior/search-history
X-User-Id: 3
Content-Type: application/json

{"keyword":"Java Book"}

### UC10 查询个人历史和热词
GET {{behavior}}/api/behavior/search-history
X-User-Id: 3

###
GET {{behavior}}/api/behavior/hot-keywords
